"grader_02_item_03","tb_0336","Tutor A","feedback","physics","tb_0336_c06","content","critical","The response must explain that you need to use angular acceleration  $\alpha=\frac{\tau}{I_{CM}}$ (not linear acceleration $a$) when considering angular velocity so that the kinematics equation becomes $\omega=\omega_0+\alpha t$.","P",""
